#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:4 f1058a31fabc419cadc49e4e9d87dc9e
msgid "QuadPlane AUTO Missions"
msgstr "QuadPlane AUTO 任务"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:6 c32d3acbefe24774b37342a7f399fce2
msgid ""
"You can ask the QuadPlane code to fly :ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` missions, "
"with everything from automatic vertical takeoff, to mixtures of fixed "
"wing and VTOL waypoints and automated VTOL landings. The result is an "
"extremely versatile aircraft capable of long range missions with vertical"
" takeoff and landing."
msgstr ""
"您可以让 QuadPlane 代码执行 :ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` 任务，涵盖从自动垂直起飞，到固定翼与 VTOL "
"航点混合，以及自动 VTOL 降落等各种功能。其结果是一架极为多功能的飞机，能够实现具备垂直起降的远程任务飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:16
#: 22b2ff883a2147f5be6a8a7af1db419f
msgid "AUTO VTOL Takeoff"
msgstr "AUTO VTOL 起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:18
#: efe709b724d442e6af2c03f430422408
msgid ""
"The most common use of VTOL mission commands in a QuadPlane is an "
"automatic VTOL takeoff. To use a VTOL takeoff you plan your auto mission "
"as usual with your ground stations mission editor, but instead of a "
"NAV_TAKEOFF command for a fixed wing takeoff you instead use a "
"NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF command for a VTOL takeoff."
msgstr ""
"在 QuadPlane 任务命令中，最常见的用途是自动 VTOL 起飞。要使用 VTOL 起飞，您需要在地面站任务编辑器中规划任务，但用 "
"NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 命令代替固定翼起飞的 NAV_TAKEOFF 命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:24
#: bbcc2785d8474c0f90446420fe84147a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The only parameter to a NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF is the altitude above the "
"takeoff point where the takeoff is complete. When executed, the aircraft "
"will start climbing at :ref:`Q_WP_SPD_UP<Q_WP_SPD_UP>`. Once that "
"altitude is reached the aircraft will move to the next waypoint, "
"transitioning to fixed wing flight as needed. The latitude and longitude "
"of the NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF command is ignored."
msgstr ""
"NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 唯一的参数是起飞完成时相对于起飞点的高度。执行时，飞机将以 "
":ref:`Q_WP_SPEED_UP<Q_WP_SPEED_UP>` "
"的速度开始爬升。到达该高度后，飞机将移动到下一个航点，并根据需要切换到固定翼飞行。NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 命令的经纬度将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:31
#: 4bb3ce9486ba4b78a9d2eb31ca892bd9
msgid ""
"If a NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF is executed when already flying, the vehicle will "
"enter VTOL mode and climb the amount given in the altitude parameter, "
"above its current altitude. This behavior can be modified by using the "
"\"respect takeoff frames\" bit of the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bitmask"
" which will skip to the next command if already at or above the altitude "
"set in the parameter, or climb to it."
msgstr ""
"如果在已飞行状态下执行 NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF，飞行器将进入 VTOL 模式并在当前高度基础上爬升高度参数所指定的量。此行为可通过 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` "
"位掩码中的「遵守起飞框架」位来修改，若已处于或高于参数所设高度，将跳到下一条命令，否则将爬升至该高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:33
#: 66df94e5bf0048b084bab33cdda5f713
msgid ""
"In order to prevent the landing gear from dragging due to GPS noise at "
"the beginning of the takeoff, you can set "
":ref:`Q_NAVALT_MIN<Q_NAVALT_MIN>` to a non zero value which will force "
"the roll and pitch to be zero until that altitude is reached. At which "
"point, navigation (ie loiter in position during the takeoff climb) will "
"become active."
msgstr ""
"为防止起飞初期因 GPS 噪声导致起落架拖地，可将 :ref:`Q_NAVALT_MIN<Q_NAVALT_MIN>` "
"设为非零值，在达到该高度之前强制横滚和俯仰保持为零。达到该高度后，导航（即起飞爬升期间的位置悬停）将变为激活状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:36
#: 6468d129f34f41889681e7fd2549dc82
msgid "AUTO VTOL Landing"
msgstr "AUTO VTOL 降落"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:38
#: 7576df9dda134807b791398031198019
msgid ""
"There are several ways to perform an automatic VTOL landing. The simplest"
" is to include a NAV_VTOL_LAND command in your mission. That command "
"should use an altitude of zero, and have a latitude and longitude of the "
"landing position."
msgstr "执行自动 VTOL 降落有几种方式。最简单的是在任务中包含一条 NAV_VTOL_LAND 命令，该命令高度应设为零，并设置降落位置的经纬度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:44
#: d84b05338bdf45499e21c2bddc2fcd8f
msgid "Versions prior to 4.1"
msgstr "4.1 版本之前"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:46
#: f5bcd6af87c144e0b003d0492bf7523c
msgid ""
"In firmware version prior to 4.1 ,when using NAV_VTOL_LAND it is "
"important to have the right horizontal spacing between that waypoint and "
"the previous one. As soon as the aircraft starts on the NAV_VTOL_LAND "
"waypoint it will transition to VTOL flight, which means it will start "
"flying much more slowly than it does in fixed wing flight. So you need to"
" put the previous waypoint the right distance from the landing point. If "
"it is too far from the landing point then the aircraft will spend a lot "
"of time in VTOL flight which will waste battery. If it is too close to "
"the landing point then it will have to stop very abruptly in order to "
"land."
msgstr ""
"在4.1之前的固件版本中，使用 NAV_VTOL_LAND 时，该航点与前一航点之间的水平间距非常重要。飞机一旦开始执行 "
"NAV_VTOL_LAND 航点，就会切换到 VTOL "
"飞行，这意味着它将比固定翼飞行慢得多。因此需要将前一航点放在距降落点合适的距离处。若距离太远，飞机将在 VTOL "
"模式中飞行较长时间，浪费电池电量；若距离太近，则飞机将不得不非常突然地停下来才能降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:56
#: 4a6fa8860c344911aa22fe97fb160d59
msgid ""
"For most small QuadPlanes a distance of between 60 and 80 meters from the"
" last waypoint to the landing point is good. For larger faster flying "
"QuadPlanes you will need a larger distance."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数小型 QuadPlane，最后一个航点到降落点的距离在60到80米之间较为合适。对于尺寸更大、飞行速度更快的 "
"QuadPlane，则需要更大的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:60
#: 9da73a699f4146009443b2d824b412d6
msgid ""
"Also make sure the altitude of the last waypoint is chosen to be within a"
" reasonable height of the landing. The VTOL landing approach will be done"
" at whatever height the aircraft is at when it starts on the "
"NAV_VTOL_LAND waypoint. So you would typically want the previous waypoint"
" to have an altitude of about 20 meters above the ground."
msgstr ""
"另外，请确保最后一个航点的高度选择在距降落点合理范围内。VTOL 降落进近将在飞机开始执行 NAV_VTOL_LAND "
"航点时的高度进行。因此通常希望前一航点的高度约为地面以上20米。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:66
#: 8dda0acc7a714ad59b9dd9e379958d0d
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` is set for \"Use a fixed wing approach\" "
"(bit 4), then instead of transitioning to VTOL flight and doing a VTOL "
"landing, it will remain in plane mode , and proceed to the landing "
"position, climbing or descending to the altitude set in the NAV_VTOL_LAND"
" waypoint. When it reaches within "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` of the landing location, it "
"will perform a LOITER_TO_ALT to finish the climb or descent to that "
"altitude set in the waypoint and using "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` for the loiter radius , then, "
"turning into the wind, transition to VTOL mode and proceed to the landing"
" location and land."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 设置了「使用固定翼进近」（第4位），则飞机不会切换到 VTOL 飞行并进行 VTOL"
" 降落，而是保持固定翼模式，飞向降落位置，同时爬升或下降至 NAV_VTOL_LAND 航点所设的高度。当到达距降落位置 "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 范围内时，将执行 LOITER_TO_ALT "
"以完成爬升或下降至航点所设高度，并使用 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` "
"作为盘旋半径，然后迎风切换到 VTOL 模式，飞向降落位置并降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:68
#: 636bc6f973c54bf1b8458b9023055e28
msgid ""
"Note that if :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` = 0, the waypoint "
"loiter radius will be used. Be sure to set the VTOL_LAND waypoint "
"altitude and :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` distance to avoid "
"obstacles. Note also, that if this waypoint is reached while in VTOL "
"mode, it will proceed as a normal VTOL_LAND command, even if the option "
"is set."
msgstr ""
"注意，若 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` = 0，将使用航点盘旋半径。请确保设置 "
"VTOL_LAND 航点高度和 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 距离以避开障碍物。另外，如果在"
" VTOL 模式下到达此航点，即使设置了该选项，也将按正常 VTOL_LAND 命令执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:70
#: 121020b2d0724adb9aac10667293cfd5
msgid ""
"Be sure that the NAV_VTOL_LAND is placed with enough distance to reach "
"the :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>`, plus at least a 90 degree "
"turn, plus distance required to de-transition to VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"请确保 NAV_VTOL_LAND 的放置位置有足够距离，以满足到达 "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 所需的距离，加上至少90度转弯所需的距离，再加上切换到 "
"VTOL 模式所需的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:75
#: fe5b84db7f684ae287a9aef89934bdde
msgid "(figure courtesy of SRP AERO   https://srp.aero/)"
msgstr "（图片由 SRP AERO 提供 https://srp.aero/)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:78
#: e903ba2b81804e5d87f3209fab275fb9
msgid "Versions 4.1 and later"
msgstr "4.1 及更高版本"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:80
#: f5c474c47c8549fda0ccefcce45fabe5
msgid ""
"By default a NAV_VTOL_LAND will remain in fixed mode at the current "
"altitude, until close to the landing point, execute an \"airbraking\" "
"maneuver to reduce speed, then transition to VTOL, navigate precisely to "
"the landing point, and descend as in QLAND to a landing. This allows "
"setting the NAV_VTOL_LAND point any distant away from the last waypoint "
"without having to worry about excessive time in VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，NAV_VTOL_LAND 将在当前高度保持固定翼模式，直到接近降落点，执行「气动制动」机动以降低速度，然后切换到 "
"VTOL，精确导航至降落点，并像 QLAND 一样下降着陆。这样无论 NAV_VTOL_LAND 点距最后一个航点多远，都不必担心在 VTOL "
"模式中耗费过多时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:82
#: 7a7031a90f8344b5a70c11150bd17249
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16 is set to disable the fixed wing "
"approach phase, then it will immediately transition to VTOL when the "
"command is executed and navigate to the landing point in VTOL mode. This "
"requires the careful setup of the last waypoint before this command to "
"avoid a long path to the landing point while in VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第16位被设置以禁用固定翼进近阶段，则执行命令时将立即切换到 VTOL，并在 "
"VTOL 模式下导航至降落点。这需要仔细设置此命令前的最后一个航点，以避免在 VTOL 模式下飞行过长的路径至降落点。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:84
#: f6da2e7f56c24e17bda2a3889ff362a9
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 is set, then even if bit 16 is set, "
"the vehicle will execute the fixed wing approach and loiter to altitude, "
"described above in the previous section, before changing to VTOL mode. If"
" bit 16 is also set, then when the vehicle switches to VTOL mode, it will"
" attempt to do the airbrake maneuver and QLAND for that final segment."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` "
"第4位被设置，则即使第16位也被设置，飞行器也将先执行固定翼进近和盘旋降高（如前一节所述），再切换到 VTOL "
"模式。如果第16位也被设置，则切换到 VTOL 模式时，将尝试执行气动制动机动并在最后阶段使用 QLAND 降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:87
#: 3264c070b72245fba5dcc91908844484
msgid "Return to Launch"
msgstr "返回起飞点"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:89
#: 6a2cdde1e86e486abfae03dee92c0a7b
msgid ""
"An alternative to using a NAV_VTOL_LAND command is to use a "
"RETURN_TO_LAUNCH command, and to set the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` "
"parameter to 1."
msgstr ""
"使用 NAV_VTOL_LAND 命令的另一种方式是使用 RETURN_TO_LAUNCH 命令，并将 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 参数设为1。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:92
#: 960fccfd594d473bb8e07890479a940b
msgid ""
"The advantage of using a RETURN_TO_LAUNCH with "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` set is that the aircraft will automatically"
" use fixed wing flight until it gets within :ref:`RTL_RADIUS "
"<RTL_RADIUS>` of the return point. That makes it easier to plan missions "
"with a VTOL landing from anywhere in the flying area."
msgstr ""
"将 RETURN_TO_LAUNCH 与 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` "
"结合使用的优势在于，飞机将自动使用固定翼飞行，直到到达返回点的 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS <RTL_RADIUS>` "
"范围内。这使得在飞行区域任何位置规划 VTOL 降落任务变得更容易。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:102
#: cf6857c97f1340ada1c79fef64c03cd9
msgid "Mixing VTOL and Fixed Wing Flight"
msgstr "混合 VTOL 与固定翼飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:104
#: aa44a947a8e94b2aa4f57216a18daeb5
msgid ""
"To mix fixed wing and VTOL flight in one mission you can use the "
"DO_VTOL_TRANSITION command in your mission. A DO_VTOL_TRANSITION command "
"takes a single parameter. If the parameter is set to 3 then the aircraft "
"will change to VTOL mode. If the parameter is set to 4 then it will "
"change to fixed wing mode."
msgstr ""
"要在一次任务中混合固定翼和 VTOL 飞行，可在任务中使用 DO_VTOL_TRANSITION 命令。DO_VTOL_TRANSITION "
"命令有一个参数：若参数设为3，飞机将切换到 VTOL 模式；若参数设为4，则切换到固定翼模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:113
#: fbd564bf9f5144549e1e61f6643f16a9
msgid ""
"In the above example the aircraft will do a VTOL takeoff, then it will "
"fly to waypoint 1 as a fixed wing aircraft. It will then switch to VTOL "
"mode and fly as a VTOL aircraft through waypoints 4 and 5, then it will "
"switch back to fixed wing flight to reach waypoint 7, before finally "
"flying home and landing as a VTOL aircraft (assuming Q_RTL_MODE is set to"
" 1)."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，飞机将先进行 VTOL 起飞，然后以固定翼飞机方式飞往航点1。然后切换到 VTOL 模式，以 VTOL "
"飞机方式飞过航点4和5，再切换回固定翼飞行到达航点7，最后以 VTOL 飞机方式飞回 Home 并降落（假设 Q_RTL_MODE 设为1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:121
#: e38c98c3f78a4a73b7e1b17f67d542c7
msgid "Hovering in a Mission"
msgstr "任务中悬停"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:123
#: b59459643e224d24977798b8adfebf54
msgid ""
"By setting the :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` parameter to 1 your "
"quadplane will handle loiter commands in :ref:`GUIDED mode <guided-mode>`"
" and in AUTO missions as a VTOL aircraft. For example, the following "
"mission:"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` 参数设为1，您的 quadplane 将在 :ref:`GUIDED"
" 模式 <guided-mode>` 和 AUTO 任务中以 VTOL 飞行器的方式处理盘旋命令。例如，以下任务："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:131
#: e5d8c9f8c0804df7bf063b5d8e553053
msgid ""
"the aircraft will pause while hovering for 10 seconds at waypoint 3. It "
"will fly the rest of the mission as a fixed wing aircraft. This can be "
"very useful for getting good photographs of a number of locations in a "
"mission while flying most of the mission as an efficient fixed wing "
"aircraft."
msgstr "飞机将在航点3处悬停10秒。其余任务段将以固定翼飞机方式飞行。这对于在任务中飞往多个地点拍摄高质量照片非常有用，同时大部分任务路程以高效的固定翼方式飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:138
#: 0995268c01c943ea83314117d2000097
msgid "Guided Mode"
msgstr "Guided 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:140
#: 35a78d6b592343398be2ced59e9b80f7
msgid ""
"In addition to AUTO mode, you can also use a QuadPlane in :ref:`GUIDED "
"mode <guided-mode>`. To use VTOL support in GUIDED mode you need to set "
"the :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` parameter to 1. When set, GUIDED"
" mode behaviour will change so that the position hold at the destination "
"will be done as a VTOL hover rather than a fixed wing circle."
msgstr ""
"除 AUTO 模式外，您也可以在 :ref:`GUIDED 模式 <guided-mode>` 中使用 QuadPlane。要在 GUIDED "
"模式中使用 VTOL 支持，需要将 :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` 参数设为1。设置后，GUIDED "
"模式的行为将改变，使得到达目标位置后的位置保持以 VTOL 悬停方式执行，而非固定翼盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:147
#: f38f905438ec45cfb22692aeed0dc973
msgid ""
"The approach to the guided waypoint will be done as a fixed wing "
"aircraft. The transition to VTOL flight will begin at the "
":ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>` radius in meters. This should be set"
" appropriately for your aircraft. A value of 80 meters is good for a wide"
" range of QuadPlanes."
msgstr ""
"飞往 Guided 航点的进近将以固定翼飞机方式进行。在距目标 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>` "
"半径（单位：米）处开始切换到 VTOL 飞行。请根据您的飞机适当设置此值，80米对于大多数 QuadPlane 均适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:153
#: 1d1fa18005684729b2746abf1233dc9b
msgid ""
"When hovering at the destination in GUIDED mode if a new GUIDED "
"destination is given then the aircraft will transition back to fixed wing"
" flight, fly to the new location and then hover again in VTOL mode."
msgstr "在 GUIDED 模式下悬停于目标位置时，若发出新的 GUIDED 目标，飞机将切换回固定翼飞行，飞往新位置，然后再次在 VTOL 模式中悬停。"

